<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>404 — Signal Lost</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    html,body{width:100%;min-height:100%;background:#000;color:#fff;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;overflow:hidden}
    body{
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 48%,rgba(255,158,80,.18) 0%,rgba(70,30,15,.08) 16%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 36%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.94) 52%,#000 100%),
        #000;
    }
    .stars,.stars::before,.stars::after{position:absolute;inset:-20%;content:"";background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,255,255,.8) 0 1px,transparent 1.5px);background-size:90px 90px;opacity:.26;animation:drift 80s linear infinite}
    .stars::before{background-size:140px 140px;opacity:.18;animation-duration:120s;transform:rotate(17deg)}
    .stars::after{background-size:220px 220px;opacity:.12;animation-duration:180s;transform:rotate(-12deg)}
    @keyframes drift{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:translate3d(-180px,120px,0)}}
    .lens{position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;width:430px;height:430px;border-radius:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(0,0,0,1) 0 18%,rgba(255,196,125,.12) 20%,rgba(255,147,75,.08) 30%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 56%);box-shadow:0 0 90px rgba(255,145,80,.08)}
    .ring{position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;width:560px;height:120px;border-radius:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-9deg);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,203,145,.38);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(113,154,180,.12);filter:blur(.2px)}
    main{position:relative;z-index:2;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:32px;text-align:center}
    .panel{width:min(680px,92vw);padding:34px 30px;border:.5px solid rgba(255,218,176,.22);border-radius:18px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.46);box-shadow:0 0 120px rgba(255,150,70,.07),inset 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.04);backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}
    .eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.22em;color:rgba(255,205,158,.58);margin-bottom:12px}
    h1{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(64px,13vw,132px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:.03em;text-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(255,200,150,.2)}
    h2{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(18px,3vw,30px);font-weight:500;margin-top:16px;letter-spacing:.08em}
    p{max-width:520px;margin:16px auto 0;color:rgba(230,238,245,.58);font-size:12px;line-height:1.8}
    a{display:inline-block;margin-top:26px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;border:.5px solid rgba(255,218,176,.34);border-radius:8px;padding:11px 18px;background:rgba(255,180,100,.06);transition:background .2s,border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}
    a:hover{background:rgba(255,180,100,.12);border-color:rgba(255,218,176,.52);box-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(255,170,95,.1)}
    .corner{position:absolute;width:28px;height:28px;border-color:rgba(151,203,232,.25);border-style:solid}
    .c1{top:18px;left:18px;border-width:1px 0 0 1px}.c2{top:18px;right:18px;border-width:1px 1px 0 0}
    .c3{bottom:18px;left:18px;border-width:0 0 1px 1px}.c4{bottom:18px;right:18px;border-width:0 1px 1px 0}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="stars"></div>
  <div class="lens"></div>
  <div class="ring"></div>
  <div class="corner c1"></div><div class="corner c2"></div><div class="corner c3"></div><div class="corner c4"></div>
  <main>
    <section class="panel">
      <div class="eyebrow">TRANSMISION INTERRUMPIDA</div>
      <h1>404</h1>
      <h2>SIGNAL LOST BEYOND EVENT HORIZON</h2>
      <p>La ruta solicitada cruzó el horizonte de eventos. La navegación automática no puede recuperar la señal desde esta coordenada.</p>
      <a href="/">REGRESAR AL OBSERVATORIO</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
